<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ARGENTINE MIDFIELDER LEAVES MONTPELLIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE MIDFIELDER LEAVES MONTPELLIER.</headline>
<dateline>MONTPELLIER, France 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine midfielder Jose Luis Villarreal is leaving Montpellier before the end of his contract with the French first division club by mutual agreement.</p>
<p>Villarreal, who joined Montpellier 18 months ago, has been plagued by injury and failed to hold down a first team place. He is negotiating with an Argentine club, whose identity has not been revealed.</p>
<p>The tall midfielder, a former Argentine international, has played for both Argentina's &quot;big two&quot;, Boca Juniors and South American champions River Plate.</p>
